sis and Mendelian randomisation investigation", "heading_path": ["Body", "RESULTS"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Traumatic dental injuries in permanent teeth among Arab children: prevalence, and associated risk factors—a systematic review and meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Components of included studies"]}]}
