latelet volume in recurrent aphthous stomatitis: Systematic review and meta-analysis of group differences", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Study sample sizes"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Platelet-to-lymphocyte ratio and mean platelet volume in recurrent aphthous stomatitis: Systematic review and meta-analysis of group differences", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Differences in MPV between RAS patients and healthy controls"]}]}
