{"question": "Nghiên cứu về phương pháp gây viêm nướu thực nghiệm đánh giá các chỉ số lâm sàng nào?", "claim": "Các phương pháp gây viêm nướu thực nghiệm đánh giá thời điểm khởi phát và tiến triển viêm nướu thông qua các chỉ số lâm sàng như Chỉ số Nướu (GI), Chảy máu khi dò (BOP) và Chỉ số Mảng bám (PI).", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu nội bộ về phương pháp nghiên cứu nha chu ghi nhận các chỉ số đánh giá viêm nướu bao gồm Gingival Index (GI), Bleeding on Probing (BOP) và Plaque Index (PI)."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "This systematic review was guided by a clearly defined research question structured according to the PICOS framework: What are the methodological variations in experimental gingivitis (EG) induction studies, and how do these differences affect the timing and progression of gingival inflammation? The population of interest includes human participants enrolled in EG studies. Interventions focus on various methods of inducing gingival inflammation, such as oral hygiene cessation and mechanical plaque accumulation. Comparisons involve different EG protocols, including variations in model design and duration. The primary outcomes assessed are the timing of inflammation onset and the progression of gingival inflammation, measured through established clinical parameters such as the Gingival Index (GI), Bleeding on Probing (BOP), and Plaque Index (PI)."}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q2", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Table 3"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q3", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Summary of Clinical and Biological Outcomes from Included Experimental Gingivitis Studies"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q4", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Study | Group Comparison | GI Difference | BOP/SBI Difference | PI Change | Systemic/Biomarker ➕"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q5", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Sidi 198411 | High vs Low sugar | — | Higher | — | No GCF change"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Systematic Review of Experimental Gingivitis Induction Methods: Methodological Variations and Their Impact on Inflammation Progression", "heading_path": ["Body", "Materials and Methods", "Focus Question"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Systematic Review of Experimental Gingivitis Induction Methods: Methodological Variations and Their Impact on Inflammation Progression", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Results of Individual Studies"]}]}
