"P2.Q10", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "b α = 0.05."}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "The Role of Electrolytes in Muscle Pain Syndromes: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis With Implications for Temporomandibular Disorder", "heading_path": ["Body", "Materials and methods", "Eligibility criteria"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Sponsorship Bias in Randomised Controlled Trials on Postoperative Pain After Third Molar Extraction: A Meta‐Research Study", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results"]}]}
