view", "heading_path": ["Body", "RESULTS", "Description of the Included Studies"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Effects of Hyaluronic Acid in the Surgical Treatment of Periodontitis: A Systematic Review", "heading_path": ["Body", "DISCUSSION", "Limitations and Recommendations"]}]}
