{"question": "Hệ thống phân phối thuốc dựa trên hạt nano (nanoparticle-based drug delivery systems) hỗ trợ điều trị viêm nha chu thông qua kích thước hạt chính xác là bao nhiêu?", "claim": "Các công thức nano dùng trong điều trị viêm nha chu có kích thước hạt dao động chính xác từ 50 đến 500 nm để tối ưu hóa khả năng thẩm thấu.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu nội bộ khuyến cáo sử dụng các hạt nano có kích thước từ 50 đến 500 nm để tối ưu hóa hiệu quả ngấm vào túi nha chu."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Since nanoparticle-mediated formulations provide target specificity and repair damaged gingival tissue, they have been demonstrated to be advantageous in treating periodontitis. Nano-formulations typically possess particles that range in size from 1 to 1000 nm. As drug delivery systems, they have controllable size, shape, and surface charge, which facilitate their penetration into periodontal pockets, plaque biofilms, and bacterial cell membranes.40–43 Treatment for periodontitis can have enhanced antibacterial and anti-inflammatory effects because nano-formulations have high activity and a large specific surface area, which allows them to interact with inflammatory mediators and periodontal pathogens and load antibacterial medications efficiently.44"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q2", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Currently, the main strategies for treating periodontitis with nanoparticles are not only antibacterial therapy alone, but also combined with immune regulation and periodontal tissue regeneration. The nano-biomaterials commonly used in nanoparticle delivery systems for treating periodontitis can be categorized according to their chemical makeup as organic or inorganic. Natural and synthetic polymers, like liposomes, poly(lactic-co-glycolic acid) (PLGA), dendrimers, etc."}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Nanoparticle-Based Drug Delivery Systems for Periodontitis: Antibacterial, Immunomodulatory, and Regenerative Strategies", "heading_path": ["Body", "Nanoparticle-Based Drug Delivery Systems for Periodontitis"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Nanoparticle-Based Drug Delivery Systems for Periodontitis: Antibacterial, Immunomodulatory, and Regenerative Strategies", "heading_path": ["Body", "Nanoparticle-Based Drug Delivery Systems for Periodontitis"]}]}
