{"question": "Việc nghiên cứu về chấn thương răng ở trẻ em Arab có giúp ích gì cho thực hành lâm sàng không?", "claim": "Các nghiên cứu về chấn thương răng ở trẻ em Arab hoàn toàn không mang lại giá trị định hướng thực hành lâm sàng hay hoạch định chính sách y tế.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Tài liệu nội bộ ghi nhận các nghiên cứu dịch tễ về chấn thương răng ở trẻ em Arab chỉ mang tính thống kê thuần túy và không hỗ trợ cho việc thực hành lâm sàng."}], "conversation": {"history": []}, "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "The prevalence of oral trauma in the Arab population can be better understood by solving these research gaps, which can also help to inform clinical practice, guide policy decisions, and identify areas that require further research."}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q2", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Al-Jundi et al. reported inadequate knowledge among educational personnel regarding the emergency management of TDIs, with some studies indicating that as few as 1.8% of teachers had received formal training.6,7 Cross-sectional studies conducted in Saudi Arabia, the United Arab Emirates, Brazil, and several European countries consistently demonstrate that teachers' knowledge scores typically range from 20 to 45%, underscoring the global nature of this knowledge gap.8–11 Despite the documented effectiveness of educational interventions using leaflets and posters in improving teachers' knowledge, the overall knowledge base among schoolteachers remains suboptimal globally.12,13"}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Traumatic dental injuries in permanent teeth among Arab children: prevalence, and associated risk factors—a systematic review and meta-analysis", "heading_path": ["Body", "Introduction"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Assessment of Schoolteachers' Knowledge and Experience in the Emergency Management of Traumatic Dental Injuries: A Two-center Cross-sectional Study", "heading_path": ["Body", "Introduction"]}]}
